# Sioona Architecture

Single Next.js app in `web/` — **not** a monorepo. No `packages/`. Do not apply parent Expo RN rules.

## Stack (current ≠ target)

| Layer | Current (code) | Do not assume until asked |
|-------|----------------|---------------------------|
| App | Next.js 15 App Router, React 19, Tailwind, Geist | — |
| Detect | Keyword heuristics + store taxonomy overrides (`detect.ts`) | LLM / vLLM / LangGraph |
| Data | JSON file `web/data/store.json` via `store.ts` | Neon + pgvector |
| Auth | None | Auth0 |

## Layout

- `web/src/app/` — routes + `api/`
- `web/src/components/` — UI (`"use client"` only when interactive)
- `web/src/lib/` — domain logic (prefer edits here)
- `web/src/data/fixtures/` — seed demo data
- `web/data/` — runtime store + samples (do **not** commit `store.json`)

Path alias: `@/*` → `./src/*`.

## Canonical files

- Types: `web/src/lib/types.ts`
- Taxonomy SoT: `web/src/lib/taxonomy.ts` (not `taxonomy.json`)
- Detect / ingest / eval / format / store: matching files in `web/src/lib/`
- Tokens + utilities: `web/src/app/globals.css`
- Chrome: `web/src/components/AppShell.tsx`

## Patterns

- RSC pages read the store directly; mutations via `fetch` to `/api/*` then `router.refresh()`
- Data pages: `export const dynamic = "force-dynamic"`
- Extend `web/src/lib/*` first; do not scaffold Phase-2 infra unless asked
